release build:
  xmake -P pc-port smg-pc
  result: build ok

debug build:
  xmake f -m debug
  xmake -r smg-pc
  result: build ok

focused tests:
  xmake -P pc-port -r smg-pc-aurora-native-tests
  build/linux/x86_64/debug/smg-pc-aurora-native-tests
  result: 27 Aurora-native test(s) passed

  build/linux/x86_64/debug/smg-pc-stage-start-camera-tests
  result: 4 stage-start camera test(s) passed

route commands:
  xmake aurora-route-smoke --disc=/workspaces/pcport/RMGK01.wbfs --display=334 --no-build gateway_handoff
  result: passed nonblack=0.0070 render_packets=604

  xmake aurora-route-smoke --disc=/workspaces/pcport/RMGK01.wbfs --display=335 --no-build title file_select picturebook
  result: title passed; file_select passed; picturebook hit an Xvfb restart race

  xmake aurora-route-smoke --disc=/workspaces/pcport/RMGK01.wbfs --display=336 --no-build picturebook
  result: passed nonblack=1.0000 render_packets=25

final integration:
  force-rebuilt full route smoke after shared exact-resource cleanup
  result: title, file_select, picturebook, and gateway_handoff all passed

